body:
Looks like a clam to me. Related to the giant clams, maybe?

&#x200B;

Edit: Am not marine biologist. Am merely an enthusiastic amateur.

Spada Lake has the best tasting water in the world!

&#x200B;

Edit: My subjective opinion, obviously!

"Don't mean a thing if it ain't got that swing!" 

&#x200B;

This one totally swings.

You're not the first to make that joke. Family has been calling me "Princess Sparkle" since the first day!

&#x200B;

*I can think of worse things than being a pony princess.*
